+    northernmost rank.  ``fold.fold_j >= 0`` is the data-dependent check:
+    the northernmost rank has ``fold_j`` set to the actual fold row index,
+    while all other ranks use ``fold_j = -1`` as a sentinel.
+    """
+    if fold is None:
+        return False
+    return getattr(fold, 'fold_j', -1) >= 0
